spans.s:
cl. 1. Ā. ˚ण्डते, to break, divide, destroy, Dhātup. viii, 31 : cl. 10. P. खण्डयति, to break, tear, break into pieces, crush, cut, divide, Pañcat.; Bhaṭṭ. (aor. अचखण्डत्) ;
to destroy, remove, annihilate, Rājat. v, 281; Naiṣ. v, 4;
to defeat, conquer, Bhaṭṭ. xii, 17;
to refute;
to interrupt, disturb, R. iii, 14, 14; Kathās.;
to disregard (an order), Rājat. vi, 229; Kathās. cxxiv, 79;
 ‘to disappoint, deceive, cheat’, see खण्डित.
